  "reasoning": "The claim that mRNA COVID-19 vaccines alter or permanently change human DNA is scientifically false. According to overwhelming medical consensus and public health organizations (including the CDC, WHO, and peer-reviewed studies), mRNA delivered by the vaccines remains in the cytoplasm of human cells and never enters the cell nucleus, where genomic DNA is housed. Furthermore, mRNA cannot integrate into the human genome because it degrades rapidly after protein translation and human cells lack the enzymatic machinery (such as reverse transcriptase and integrase) required to convert vaccine mRNA into DNA and integrate it.",
